<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back 500,000 more shares.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back 500,000 more shares.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand on Wednesday said it had bought back a further 500,000 of its shares at prices between NZ$6.45 and $6.48 pursuant to its $1 billion on-market share repurchase programme.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
